{
  "title": { "en": "Find the routes" },
  "short": { "en": "Trace them one by one on a one-way map" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "Here is a map of a small town. <b>Each place is a cell and each one-way street is an arrow</b>, and you can only travel the way the arrows point."
      },
      "fig": {
        "scene": {
          "cells": [
            { "id": "H", "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "Home" } },
            { "id": "A", "x": -85, "y": 120, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "Bakery" } },
            { "id": "B", "x": 85, "y": 120, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "Park" } },
            { "id": "T", "x": 0, "y": 240, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "School" } }
          ],
          "edges": [
            { "a": "H", "b": "A", "cls": "idle", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "H", "b": "B", "cls": "idle", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "A", "b": "B", "cls": "idle", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "A", "b": "T", "cls": "idle", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "B", "b": "T", "cls": "idle", "bend": 0, "off": 0 }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "A <b>route</b> is a sequence of places that starts at Home, follows the arrows stop by stop, and ends at School. For example: Home → Bakery → School."
      },
      "fig": {
        "scene": {
          "cells": [
            { "id": "H", "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "Home" }, "cls": "path" },
            {
              "id": "A",
              "x": -85,
              "y": 120,
              "w": 84,
              "h": 64,
              "label": { "en": "Bakery" },
              "cls": "path"
            },
            { "id": "B", "x": 85, "y": 120, "w": 84, "h": 64, "label": { "en": "Park" } },
            {
              "id": "T",
              "x": 0,
              "y": 240,
              "w": 84,
              "h": 64,
              "label": { "en": "School" },
              "cls": "path"
            }
          ],
          "edges": [
            { "a": "H", "b": "A", "cls": "good", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "H", "b": "B", "cls": "dim", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "A", "b": "B", "cls": "dim", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "A", "b": "T", "cls": "good", "bend": 0, "off": 0 },
            { "a": "B", "b": "T", "cls": "dim", "bend": 0, "off": 0 }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "en": "Find <b>every</b> route yourself: start at “Home”, click places one after another along the arrows, and each time you reach “School” a route is recorded."
      }
    }
  ],
  "mission": {
    "goal": {
      "en": "Find all the routes from Home to School. You can only go the way the arrows point (one-way streets)."
    },
    "how": {
      "en": "Start at “Home” and click places in order along the arrows. If you click a wrong one, click the last place again to step back."
    }
  },
  "debrief": {
    "title": { "en": "3 routes in all" },
    "body": [
      {
        "en": "With only 4 places on the map, tracing routes one by one isn’t too tiring."
      },
      {
        "en": "But add a few more places and there are too many routes to trace, and it is easy to miss one or count one twice."
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "en": "A route = a sequence of places leading from the start to the end along the arrows."
    }
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "trace",
      "mode": "trace",
      "cells": [
        { "id": "H", "x": 0, "y": 0, "label": { "en": "Home" } },
        { "id": "A", "x": -85, "y": 120, "label": { "en": "Bakery" } },
        { "id": "B", "x": 85, "y": 120, "label": { "en": "Park" } },
        { "id": "T", "x": 0, "y": 240, "label": { "en": "School" } }
      ],
      "edges": [["H", "A"], ["H", "B"], ["A", "B"], ["A", "T"], ["B", "T"]],
      "start": "H",
      "end": "T"
    }
  ]
